  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a45b5b9191c13cd4da310eb8df100becb078c240f4b0e763420ec154fb42a5fd.png] \n\n**Give: **104 ÷ 8 - 15 + 4 × 26 = 21\n\nLet's check options one by one.\n\n**Option 1) 8 and 26**\n\n⇒ 104 ÷ 26 - 15 + __**4 × 8**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**4**__ - 15__** + 32**__ = 21\n\n⇒** 36 - 15 = 21**\n\nOption 2) 15 and 4\n\n⇒ __**104 ÷ 8**__ - 4 + __**15 × 26**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**13**__ - 4** __+ 390__** = 21 \n\n⇒ **403 - 4 = 399** ≠ 21\n\nOption 3) 8 and 15\n\n⇒ __**104 ÷ 15**__ - 8 + __**4 × 26**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**6.9**__ - 8 __**+ 104**__ = 21\n\n**⇒ 110.9 - 8 = 102.9** ≠ 21\n\nOption 4) 15 and 26\n\n⇒ __**104 ÷ 8**__ - 26 + __**4 × 15**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**13**__ - 26__** + 60**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 73 - 26 = 47 ≠ 21.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\".**",
